  "content": "<h1>鞘翅紋飾擴展</h1><p><em>覺得原版紋飾不夠用？或者你最愛的模組新增了更多盔甲紋飾，卻唯獨缺少鞘翅版本？\n鞘翅紋飾擴展來滿足你！</em></p><h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.kikugie.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord邀請連結</a>（專為CurseForge設置，因為它<em>至今</em>仍無法正確解析Markdown語法）</h1><h1>安裝說明</h1><p>請先於客戶端安裝主模組（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鞘翅紋飾</a>），附加紋飾將會自動載入。</p><h1>支援模組清單</h1><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-armor-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多盔甲紋飾</a>（Fabric版）</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/a14a4a8064a83654e28aa4fe363154df7bf6c5d5.png\" alt=\"MAT #1\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/9e5e1ecde0fa793bf9b79d7babe8849d0052e0d1.png\" alt=\"MAT #2\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/1ea603724a77fa24b0b12c45d1703b1382da9b9b.png\" alt=\"MAT #3\"></p><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fancient-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遠古天境</a>（Forge版）</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/28a1dfedb6c8de817db8dd33807d5ddc3a4d661f.png\" alt=\"AA #1\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/83d1eedaf6d66d514b570bab0423fb5bc248e156.png\" alt=\"AA #2\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/aa7ea20d9a5f544069cd1cab113d2ab10b0e1716.png\" alt=\"AA #3\"></p><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeode-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">晶洞+</a>（Fabric與Forge雙版本）</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/ebf229dc9ad8252384e5c12864500510c3e67d95.png\" alt=\"Geode+\"></p><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffrostiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">霜雪奇緣</a>（Fabric版）</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/36eec29b7e833b958fb31099db8871a305fe68d8.png\" alt=\"Frostiful\"></p><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">亞歷克斯洞穴</a>（Forge版）</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/14fe7e56d92683cd77f9f5401db8894698b1d444.png\" alt=\"AC\"></p><hr><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-sniffer-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多嗅探花</a>（Forge版）</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/b673ff8837f5cd36b8988acf0fb8f8798cf937fc.png\" alt=\"MSF\"></p><h1>支援本模組</h1><p>若您知曉其他新增紋飾圖案的模組或資料包，歡迎透過GitHub議題回報系統提交，或於Discord伺服器私訊本人！</p>\n\n（注：已根据繁体中文用语习惯进行本地化调整，包括：\n1. \"Elytra\"统一译为「鞘翅」\n2. \"Trims\"译为「紋飾」而非简体中文的「镶边」\n3. 使用「模組」替代「模组」\n4. 采用「客戶端」「自動」「支援」等繁体标准用词\n5. 保留所有超链接与图片标签结构不变\n6. 专业术语如Fabric/Forge保持原文\n7. 语气词调整为繁体中文常用表达方式）",
